#: data/script/fcitx-diagnose.sh:689
msgid ""
"If you are using ${1}, you may want to uninstall ${2}, remove ${3} or use "
"the command ${g36_disable_ibus} to disable IBus integration in order to use "
"any input method other than ${2}. See ${link} for more detail."
msgstr ""
"Se utilizatz ${1}, desiratz benlèu desinstallar ${2}, suprimir ${3} o "
"utilizar la comanda ${g36_disable_ibus} per desactivar l'integracion d'IBus "
"per fin d'utilizar quin metòde de sasida diferent que siá de ${2}. Veire "
"${link} per mai de detalhs."

#: data/script/fcitx-diagnose.sh:691
